{
  "$comment": [
    "What this repository ships, pinned by hand.",
    "",
    "internal/bundle/manifest.json records the same revision, but it is a",
    "generated file: it is rewritten by `make bundle` without anybody deciding",
    "anything, so a change there reads as noise in review and proves only that",
    "the generator ran. This file is written by a person moving the pin, so a",
    "diff here is an intentional act with a reason attached — and `make",
    "upstream-check` reads it to say how far upstream has moved since.",
    "",
    "`entries` is the bundled plugin set at the versions their package.json",
    "carried at `commit`. It must stay in step with ENTRIES in",
    "tools/bundle/build.mjs; make upstream-check fails when it does not."
  ],
